      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 200000\n    monthly_interest_rate = 0.0033\n    total_periods = 20 * 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    if monthly_interest_rate == 0:\n        monthly_payout = principal / total_periods\n    else:\n        growth_factor = (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** total_periods\n        monthly_payout = (\n            principal\n            * monthly_interest_rate\n            * growth_factor\n            / (growth_factor - 1)\n        )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(monthly_payout)\n```",
